@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
left to right direction
rectangle "requested\n(control expression)" as req
rectangle "safe\n(after arbitration\nand constraints)" as safe
rectangle "logical result\ncommitted atomically\n(runtime)" as commit
rectangle "applied\n(renderer sent\nbus command)" as applied
rectangle "confirmed\n(feedback evidence:\ncontact/mechanism moved)" as conf
req --> safe
safe --> commit
commit --> applied
applied --> conf
note bottom of conf
  Three different facts:
  commit != applied != confirmed
end note
@enduml
